    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's just so heavy. I look at my hands and I don't even recognize them anymore. They've only ever known how to hold a sword or a shield, or hold on to people I eventually lost. Now they're just shaking in the dark. You talk about peace like it's something I can just step into. But everything I've ever known is broken. Is there even any point in trying to rebuild when the foundations are gone?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
