    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But it's not just about rebuilding. It's the emptiness. It's like there's this constant, aching pull toward the end of it all. I look at this blade, and for the first time in my life, it doesn't feel like a weapon for war. It feels like an exit. Like the only way to actually stop the shaking and the noise is to just... let the story end here. Why does that feel like the only thing that makes sense anymore?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
